      "biography": {
        "value": "<h2>Description</h2><p>It skewers prey with its tusks, extracting game from the safety and comfort of burrows.</p><h2>Defense</h2><p>AC 15, touch 12, flat-footed 13 (+2 Dex, +3 natural)</p><p>hp 26 [40] (4d8+8)</p><p>Fort +6, Ref +6, Will +2</p><p>Resist Fire 5</p><p>Weakness Ice</p><h2>Offense</h2><p>Speed 40 ft.</p><p>Melee 2 Claws +6 (1d6+3 plus grab), Gore +7 (1d8+3 plus trip when charging)</p><p>Space 5 ft.; Reach 5 ft.</p><p>Special Attacks Powerful Charge, Rake (2 claws +6, 1d6+3)</p><h2>Statistics</h2><p>Str 16, Dex 15, Con 15, Int 2, Wis 12, Cha 8</p><p>Base Atk +3; CMB +6 (+10 grapple); CMD 18 (22 vs. trip)</p><p>Feats Skill Focus (Perception), Weapon Focus (Gore)</p><p>Skills Acrobatics +7, Perception +8, Stealth +7, Swim +8; Racial Modifiers +4 Perception, +4 Survival when tracking by scent</p>"
